Package: motiongrammar
Title: Tidy tools to analyse tracking data
Version: 0.1
Authors@R:
    person("David",
     "Corbett",
     , "corbett.davidm@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Motion Grammar is designed as a tidyverse-friendly package to load,
    process, analyse and summarise human tracking data from GPS, RFID and Optical
    Tracking Data Sources.
